  - id: start
    speaker: Transmitter
    line: The dish hums, half-awake. Somewhere under the static there is a voice
      that has been waiting.
    discoverTopicId: 
    choices:
    - label: Listen closer.
      nextId: more
      requiredTopicId: 
      requiredTrust: 0
      lockedReason: 
      isLeave: 0
      isKey: 1
    - label: Leave it be.
      nextId: 
      requiredTopicId: 
      requiredTrust: 0
      lockedReason: 
      isLeave: 1
      isKey: 0
  - id: more
    speaker: Transmitter
    line: Not words yet. A rhythm, patient as tide. Whoever is sending it expects
      you to still be here tomorrow.
    discoverTopicId: 
    choices:
    - label: Stay a while, then go.
      nextId: 
